          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Nov 04 2019 15:08:03 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Stryker (NYSE: SYK) announced today a definitive agreement to acquire all of the issued and outstanding ordinary shares of Wright Medical Group N.V. (NASDAQ: WMGI) for $30.75 per share, or a total equity value of approximately $4.0 billion and a total enterprise value of approximately $5.4 billion (including convertible notes). Wright Medical, which was founded in 1950, is a global medical device company focused on extremities and biologics.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2019/Stryker-announces-definitive-agreement-to-acquire-Wright-Medical/default.aspx\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">READ FULL PRESS RELEASE HERE</span></a></p>\n",
